              "condition": "onLevelStart",
              "type": "popup_hint",
              "position": "top",
              "text": "📜 大师手记：「笼子又回来了。注意看——有些笼子伸进了行里，有些伸了出去。用星衡法则，你能算出那个'多出来'的格子。」",
              "once": true
            },
            {
              "id": "t205_first",
              "condition": "onFirstNumberFilled",
              "type": "popup_hint",
              "position": "top",
              "text": "📜 「漂亮。这就是单格差值法——用整体减去已知，得到未知。简单，但是最基础的武器。」",
              "once": true
            },
            {
              "id": "t205_b",
              "condition": "onFillCountReached",
              "count": 66,
              "type": "enter_phase",
              "phase": "breakthrough",
              "once": true
